  "initial_instruction": "이 플랫폼의 특징은 설치형이지만 다양한 CLI를 쓸 수 있고 그런거에 종속 되지 않음. 이 위에서 그런걸 이용하는 방식으로 동작.",
  "result_summary": "Added REQ-WS-053 and a CLI-neutral adapter boundary for the installable platform. The platform is documented as an installable workspace/orchestration layer that may use many CLIs through replaceable adapters, while missing optional CLIs degrade as capability_missing instead of breaking the whole platform. The change added a self-documenting CLI adapter registry, policy, workflow, prompt, desktop productization updates, persistent rules, memory bootstrap anchors, source records, specs, history, timing, grounding, and evaluation artifacts.",
